OL,3,AAmazon seeks to expand UK drone
OL,4,Adeliveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FRetail giant Amazon has put an
OL,7,Fapplication in to expand its drone
OL,8,Fdelivery service to cover an entire
OL,9,Ftown where it has been trialling the
OL,10,Ftech.
OL,12,FThe US company announced last January
OL,13,Fthat Darlington would be its test
OL,14,Fcentre in the UK, marking the first
OL,15,Ftime Prime Air had operated outside the
OL,16,FUSA.
OL,18,FIt started a "limited" number of
OL,19,Fflights in Febraury, allowing customers
OL,20,Fwithin a 7.5 mile radius of its County
OL,21,FDurham site to have certain items
OL,22,Fdelivered by drone.
