OL,3,AAmazon seeks to expand UK drone
OL,4,Adeliveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter more than 500 flights and
OL,7,Fdeliveries, the firm said it is now
OL,8,Fseeking approval from the Civil
OL,9,FAviation Authority to cover the whole
OL,10,Fof Darlington.
